  "fullText": "Now offering an off-site tuning session at cost to three selected teams in 2026. Apply Here\n\nSTRATEGIC\nTUNING\nFOR TEAMS\n\nSet the foundation for effective collective decision-making\n\nSpecial Offer for Startup Teams in 2026\n\nYou’ve got a big moment coming up.\n\n\nThe vision is clear, the goals are set, but even great strategies can get tripped up by what’s under the surface: how your team handles tension, how decisions get made, how power is shared, and all the unspoken patterns that shape how you work together.\n\nThat’s where we come in.\n\nBefore your next big strategic push, we’ll create a focused, supportive space for your team to see those patterns clearly and to experiment with new ways of working together.\n\nIn 2026, we’re inviting three teams to try a Tuning Session ahead of their next strategic meeting - offered at cost - to see how much smoother things can run when the team itself is in tune.\n\nTeams stall when hidden dynamics take over. \nTuning allows your team to surface and process these dynamics so your team can move forward together.\nWhat you get \n\nAt-cost Tuning Session for your team to be delivered before a strategic moment or event for your team. \n\nDesign session to help Heartwood understand your needs, and to build the Tuning Session specifically for your team and your team's opportunities \n\n1-day, in-person facilitated tuning session with the Heartwood team \n\nPost-session debrief to capture and integrate learnings\n\nInvestment\n\nFacilitation is on us!\n\nYou provide:\n\n$5,320 for deployment and administration\n\nFunds for coach travel and venue (or billed at actuals)\n\nTeam willingness and energy to improve how you make decisions and execute against your strategy together\n\nWhat to expect\n\nWorking intentionally with implicit patterns helps to create explicit culture and effective collaboration.\n\nA pressurized container to surface the patterns that impact your team execution\n\nCo-created strategies for navigating these patterns together\n\nSupport in integrating these strategies into your explicit culture\n\nHow to apply\n\nApply below or nominate a team\n\nFill in the application for your team or for a team you want to nominate\n\nA Heartwood team member will reach out to schedule a fit call, in which we will assess if a Tuning Session is right for your team at this time\n\nSchedule and complete the fit call\n\nYou'll hear back from our team if your team has been selected\n\nNominate a team\nApply Now\nA Tuning Session is right for:\n\nStrategic teams, including leadership teams, cross-functional teams, or functional groups operating at a strategic level\n\nTeams that have an existing cadence of gathering to align on strategy\n\nTeams struggling with alignment and/or execution\n\nTune before a strategic action requiring alignment, such as:\n\nOffsites\n\nBoard Meetings\n\nStrategic Planning Sessions\n\nLeadership Offsites\n\nCompany Retreats\n\nUnlock your team’s potential\n\nApplications open October 2025\n\nApply by April 1\n\nFinalists chosen by May 1\n\nTuning Sessions to be scheduled after May 1\n\nApply\nNominate a Team\nTogetherness that works\n\nWe facilitate the growth of individuals and groups to create high-functioning teams.\n\nGet Started\nNewsletter + Podcast\n\nWomens Retreat\n\nStories, insights, and new ideas from Heartwood. Get our monthly Newsletter, new podcast episodes and more by subsribing to Heartwood Collective on Substack. \n\nEvents\n\nVC Retreat\n\nFollow\n\nLinkedIn\n\nGet in touch\n\nhello@thehwc.com\n\nSubstack\n\nYoutube\n\nSelf-Transforming Teams\n\nHome\n\nThe Team\n\nFor Companies\n\nFor Investors\n\nTO TOP\n\nWe Respect your Privacy - Privacy Policy  | Data Processing Policy\n2025 Heartwood Collective, a part of Project Atlas LLC.\nCookie Preferences"
